---
import BaseHead from "../components/BaseHead.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
import Header from "../components/Header.astro";
import { SITE_TITLE } from "../consts";
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead
			title={`About | ${SITE_TITLE}`}
			description="About Abhishek — data analyst and AI builder."
		/>
	</head>
	<body class="bg-grid">
		<canvas id="bg-canvas" class="fixed-canvas" aria-hidden="true"></canvas>
		<div class="ambient-glow-1" aria-hidden="true"></div>
		<div class="ambient-glow-2" aria-hidden="true"></div>

		<Header />
		<main>
			<div class="page-container">
				<div class="badge-pill mb-4">
					<span class="pulse-dot"></span>
					<span>BACKGROUND &amp; PHILOSOPHY</span>
				</div>

				<h1 class="gradient-text page-title">About</h1>

				<div class="spotlight-card glass-panel about-card">
					<p class="lead-text">
						I'm Abhishek, a Senior Data Analyst with 5.5+ years turning
						messy, high-volume data into decisions people actually trust.
						I've worked across ad-tech (currently supporting Reddit's
						revenue analytics at iOPEX Technologies), ed-tech (Novatr), and
						digital commerce (magicpin) — three very different data
						environments, one consistent discipline: <strong class="text-white">validate first,
						automate second, explain always.</strong>
					</p>

					<!-- Experience Highlights -->
					<div class="companies-row">
						<span class="company-tag">Reddit (via iOPEX)</span>
						<span class="company-tag">Novatr</span>
						<span class="company-tag">magicpin</span>
						<span class="company-tag">Anthropic AI Certified</span>
					</div>

					<p>
						Along the way that's meant building forecasting and
						variance-analysis frameworks that catch quota risk before it
						becomes a missed quarter, designing cohort dashboards that
						reduced learner drop-off and lifted course completion by 25%,
						and building the single-source-of-truth systems that stop "whose
						number is right?" from derailing a stakeholder meeting.
					</p>
					<p>
						More recently, I've been applying that same rigor to applied AI
						— completing Anthropic's AI Fluency Framework and Claude 101
						certifications, and building lightweight, practical AI tools
						(including one running live on this site's <a href="/tool" class="highlight-link"
							>Tool page</a
						>) that solve real, narrow problems instead of chasing hype.
					</p>

					<div class="action-banner glass-panel">
						<p class="banner-text">
							If you're dealing with a revenue number nobody fully trusts, a
							dashboard that's gone stale, or a process that's still manual
							because "we haven't gotten to automating it yet" — that's
							exactly the kind of problem I like solving.
						</p>
						<a href="/services" class="btn-primary">
							<span>See how I can help →</span>
						</a>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</main>
		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>

<style>
	.fixed-canvas {
		position: fixed;
		inset: 0;
		width: 100vw;
		height: 100vh;
		pointer-events: none;
		z-index: 0;
		opacity: 0.5;
	}

	.page-container {
		max-width: 860px;
		margin: 0 auto;
	}

	.page-title {
		margin-bottom: 2rem;
	}

	.about-card {
		padding: 3rem 2.5rem;
	}

	.lead-text {
		font-size: 1.18rem;
		line-height: 1.8;
		color: #e2e8f0;
		margin-bottom: 1.75rem;
	}

	.text-white {
		color: #ffffff;
	}

	.companies-row {
		display: flex;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		gap: 0.75rem;
		margin-bottom: 2rem;
		padding-bottom: 1.75rem;
		border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
	}

	.company-tag {
		padding: 0.35rem 0.85rem;
		border-radius: 0.5rem;
		background: var(--bg-dark-900);
		border: 1px solid rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.25);
		font-family: var(--font-mono);
		font-size: 0.8rem;
		color: var(--brand-cyan-light);
	}

	.about-card p {
		font-size: 1.05rem;
		line-height: 1.75;
		color: #cbd5e1;
		margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
	}

	.highlight-link {
		color: var(--brand-400);
		font-weight: 600;
		text-decoration: underline;
		text-underline-offset: 3px;
	}

	.action-banner {
		margin-top: 2.5rem;
		padding: 2rem;
		background: rgba(11, 13, 20, 0.8);
		border: 1px solid rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.3);
		border-radius: 1rem;
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 1.25rem;
		align-items: flex-start;
	}

	.banner-text {
		margin: 0 !important;
		font-size: 1.05rem;
		color: #e2e8f0 !important;
	}

	@media (max-width: 640px) {
		.about-card {
			padding: 2rem 1.5rem;
		}
		.action-banner {
			padding: 1.5rem;
		}
	}
</style>
